{"3225420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Recharge: Room Games", "steam_appid": 3225420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4042350], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/6a5b492ca7a18a0d91c1b4eb301f25d8.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/d4f17b922c177abe0d33f000b8a6370f.poster.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/d4f17b922c177abe0d33f000b8a6370f.webm?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/d4f17b922c177abe0d33f000b8a6370f.mp4?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience RC racing like never before in Recharge, a true sim-cade game that blends arcade fun with simulation-inspired handling. Enjoy realistic physics, impressive graphics and deep customization options. Race solo or with friends across diverse tracks, from professional RC circuits to real-world inspired environments. With broad controller support, including RC-style controllers and gamepads, Recharge delivers a dynamic and authentic RC racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/81edcbfbff243054d27381f80f3b5035.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/bd43a0baefe9664232e487fa57f82efc.poster.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/bd43a0baefe9664232e487fa57f82efc.webm?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/bd43a0baefe9664232e487fa57f82efc.mp4?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recharge caters to both solo racers and competitive spirits, offering an experience that suits your preferred playstyle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In singleplayer, face AI opponents at different difficulty levels or challenge your ghost to improve your best times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer supports up to 12 players in online races, with private lobbies for friends or public lobbies for wider competition.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode brings intense racing action, whether you’re honing your skills alone or battling it out with others.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/827ac31cad7e3cfafdb410986b7dcc7c.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/182812cfea59aa5762ffb49976e2f3d1.poster.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/182812cfea59aa5762ffb49976e2f3d1.webm?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/182812cfea59aa5762ffb49976e2f3d1.mp4?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recharge lets you build an RC car that feels uniquely yours, blending performance upgrades with personalized style.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your car’s performance by upgrading the motor, ESC and chassis to meet any challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the look with paint, stickers and body choices, creating a distinctive appearance on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the perfect balance of speed, control and style that matches how you want to.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/2e3637cda41d6bda342c01f6b955384b.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/7f5223a30375a81bb7d6766b77fa9ecb.poster.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/7f5223a30375a81bb7d6766b77fa9ecb.webm?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/7f5223a30375a81bb7d6766b77fa9ecb.mp4?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recharge offers a wide variety of tracks, each crafted to deliver a distinct RC racing experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race in professional RC circuits inspired by real professional tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the action to the beach, amusement parks and skateparks, bringing the thrill of real-world locations into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each track challenges you in a unique way, offering fresh racing experiences that keep you coming back for more.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/6a5b492ca7a18a0d91c1b4eb301f25d8.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/d4f17b922c177abe0d33f000b8a6370f.poster.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/d4f17b922c177abe0d33f000b8a6370f.webm?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/d4f17b922c177abe0d33f000b8a6370f.mp4?t=1766247377\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience RC racing like never before in Recharge, a true sim-cade game that blends arcade fun with simulation-inspired handling. Enjoy realistic physics, impressive graphics and deep customization options. Race solo or with friends across diverse tracks, from professional RC circuits to real-world inspired environments. With broad controller support, including RC-style controllers and gamepads, Recharge delivers a dynamic and authentic RC racing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/81edcbfbff243054d27381f80f3b5035.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/bd43a0baefe9664232e487fa57f82efc.poster.avif?t=1766247377\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3225420/extras/bd